      "id": "claim_b823ac1ae2804800ae8f17a8a5d42f91",
      "statement": "agent/server.py:get_agent assembles the main coding agent's static_tools list covering web access (http_request, fetch_url, web_search), plan lifecycle (approve_plan, enter_plan_mode, save_plan), background execution (background_execute, background_task), user instructions and skills, Linear, thread operations (list_threads, get_thread, manage_thread), notifications, baby-sit management, PR creation/review, sandbox recovery, scheduling, user-settings lookup, and Slack tools; signed sandbox download tools are included only when enabled.",
