      "id": "claim_48b01057d195429f9da61ae78c526e3e",
      "statement": "PLAN_MODE_EXCLUDED_TOOLS removes side-effecting curated tools during planning — delegation (task), background execution (background_execute/background_task), browser interaction (expose_port), mutable HTTP (http_request), baby-sit (manage_baby_sit), thread mutation (manage_thread), PR actions (open_pull_request, request_pr_review, expedite_pr_approval), sandbox control (recreate_sandbox), user skills (save_user_skill, delete_user_skill), Slack mutation (slack_move_thread, slack_start_new_thread), workspace mutation (publish_workspace, refresh_workspace_start, delete_workspace), and automation mutation — while list_threads, get_thread, approve_plan, and built-ins write_file/edit_file/execute remain available.",
